        "\n",
        "## Data wrangling\n",
        "\n",
        "GeoPandas is conveniently built on top of `pandas`, so we may use everything we have learned about data selection, wrangling, and modification for a `pandas.DataFrame` to wrangle `geopandas.GeoDataFrame`s.\n",
